## Method

Reduction at a prime `v` above `7`, with M. Stoll's `EllipticCurves.ReductionAtPrime`
(`eq_zero_of_isOfFinAddOrder_of_red_eq_zero`: reduction at a good prime `v` with `p ∈ v`, `p ∉ v^(p−1)` is
injective on the whole torsion subgroup; no condition "prime to `p`").

* Dedekind domain: Mathlib's quadratic order `O = QuadraticAlgebra ℤ 2 0 = ℤ[ω]`, `ω² = 2`, is the integral
